# Accessibility Features

Accessibility is not an add-on.

Accessibility is a core platform capability.

## Live Captions

Convert speech into real-time captions.

Features:

* Speaker identification
* Multiple languages
* Caption history
* Export transcripts

## Sign Language Mode

Convert spoken communication into sign language representation.

Future support:

* 3D avatars
* Regional sign languages
* User customization

## Voice-to-Text

Convert participant speech into text messages and meeting notes.

## Text-to-Speech

Allow typed messages to be spoken aloud during meetings.

Useful for:

* Speech-impaired users
* Quiet environments
* Multimodal communication

## Low Bandwidth Mode

Allow participation using:

* Audio only
* Captions only
* Text only

This is particularly important for users in emerging markets and low-connectivity environments.

