# Engineering Rules

1. Do not build custom signaling infrastructure unless absolutely necessary.

2. Prefer managed communication infrastructure such as LiveKit.

3. Focus engineering effort on accessibility and AI features.

4. Every major feature should improve communication effectiveness.

5. Accessibility features must be available to all users, not only users with disabilities.

6. The platform should work well on low-bandwidth networks common across Africa and emerging markets.

---

# Success Definition

Talk2Me succeeds when users choose it not because it is another meeting app, but because it enables better communication than any other platform.

The mission is simple:

"Make every conversation accessible, understandable, and inclusive for everyone."
